Object.assign(L.fr,{"Pricing is in a controlled rollout. Checkout is sandbox-only during testing; live charges remain disabled until production approval. Nigerian NGN purchases through Flutterwave provide 30 days of access and require manual renewal. Paddle plans outside Africa are monthly recurring subscriptions. Other currency displays are fixed catalogue prices, not live exchange rates; taxes and available payment methods are confirmed by the provider at checkout.":"Les tarifs sont déployés progressivement. Le paiement reste en mode test pendant les essais ; les paiements réels sont désactivés jusqu’à leur approbation. Les achats en NGN au Nigeria via Flutterwave donnent accès pendant 30 jours et nécessitent un renouvellement manuel. Les forfaits Paddle hors d’Afrique sont des abonnements mensuels récurrents. Les autres devises sont des prix fixes du catalogue, et non des taux de change en temps réel ; les taxes et moyens de paiement disponibles sont confirmés par le prestataire au paiement.","Use AI credits for brainstorming, first drafts, rewriting, summaries and structured content assistance. Usage is checked and deducted on the server; credit top-ups are added only after payment verification.":"Utilisez les crédits IA pour réfléchir, rédiger, reformuler, résumer et structurer du contenu. L’utilisation est vérifiée et déduite sur le serveur ; les recharges ne sont ajoutées qu’après vérification du paiement.","✦ Server-side credit checks; top-ups are granted only after verified payment":"✦ Vérification des crédits côté serveur ; recharges accordées uniquement après validation du paiement","The Free plan includes the published free allowances. Paid studios and quotas depend on your plan and the specific feature; some specialist engines remain in preview until their service is enabled.":"L’offre gratuite comprend les quotas gratuits publiés. Les studios payants et leurs limites dépendent de votre forfait et de la fonction concernée ; certains moteurs spécialisés restent en aperçu jusqu’à leur activation.","Core workspace and browser-based studio tools are available. Some specialist engines and advanced cloud workflows remain in staged rollout. Checkout is sandbox-only during testing; live charges are not enabled.":"L’espace de travail principal et les outils studio exécutés dans le navigateur sont disponibles. Certains moteurs spécialisés et flux cloud avancés sont déployés progressivement. Le paiement est en mode test ; les paiements réels ne sont pas activés.","The catalogue rates are ₦4, $0.50, £0.37, €0.35 and CA$0.68 per credit. The final amount is calculated on the server in the selected currency. Credit top-ups are added only after the payment provider confirms the transaction.":"Les tarifs du catalogue sont de ₦4, 0,50 $, 0,37 £, 0,35 € et 0,68 CA$ par crédit. Le montant final est calculé sur le serveur dans la devise choisie. Les crédits ne sont ajoutés qu’après confirmation de la transaction par le prestataire.","Nigerian Flutterwave purchases provide 30 days of access and do not renew automatically; purchase again to continue. Paddle plans outside Africa renew monthly. Until in-app cancellation is available, manage a Paddle subscription through its customer portal or provider emails.":"Les achats Flutterwave au Nigeria donnent accès pendant 30 jours et ne se renouvellent pas automatiquement ; effectuez un nouvel achat pour continuer. Les forfaits Paddle hors d’Afrique sont renouvelés chaque mois. En attendant l’annulation intégrée, gérez votre abonnement Paddle depuis le portail client ou les e-mails du prestataire.","No payment details required":"Aucune donnée de paiement requise","Monthly plan; regional renewal rules apply":"Forfait mensuel ; les règles de renouvellement dépendent de la région"});
Object.assign(L.pt,{"Pricing is in a controlled rollout. Checkout is sandbox-only during testing; live charges remain disabled until production approval. Nigerian NGN purchases through Flutterwave provide 30 days of access and require manual renewal. Paddle plans outside Africa are monthly recurring subscriptions. Other currency displays are fixed catalogue prices, not live exchange rates; taxes and available payment methods are confirmed by the provider at checkout.":"Os preços estão a ser disponibilizados gradualmente. O checkout permanece em modo de teste durante a validação; os pagamentos reais estão desativados até aprovação para produção. As compras em NGN na Nigéria via Flutterwave dão 30 dias de acesso e exigem renovação manual. Os planos Paddle fora de África são subscrições mensais recorrentes. Os restantes valores são preços fixos do catálogo, não taxas de câmbio em tempo real; impostos e métodos de pagamento disponíveis são confirmados pelo fornecedor no checkout.","Use AI credits for brainstorming, first drafts, rewriting, summaries and structured content assistance. Usage is checked and deducted on the server; credit top-ups are added only after payment verification.":"Utilize créditos de IA para ideias, primeiros rascunhos, reformulação, resumos e apoio à criação de conteúdo. O consumo é verificado e descontado no servidor; as recargas só são adicionadas após a verificação do pagamento.","✦ Server-side credit checks; top-ups are granted only after verified payment":"✦ Créditos verificados no servidor; recargas concedidas apenas após pagamento confirmado","The Free plan includes the published free allowances. Paid studios and quotas depend on your plan and the specific feature; some specialist engines remain in preview until their service is enabled.":"O plano Gratuito inclui os limites gratuitos publicados. Os estúdios pagos e as quotas dependem do plano e da funcionalidade; alguns motores especializados permanecem em pré-visualização até serem ativados.","Core workspace and browser-based studio tools are available. Some specialist engines and advanced cloud workflows remain in staged rollout. Checkout is sandbox-only during testing; live charges are not enabled.":"O espaço de trabalho principal e as ferramentas de estúdio no navegador estão disponíveis. Alguns motores especializados e fluxos avançados na nuvem estão a ser lançados por etapas. O checkout está em modo de teste; os pagamentos reais não estão ativados.","The catalogue rates are ₦4, $0.50, £0.37, €0.35 and CA$0.68 per credit. The final amount is calculated on the server in the selected currency. Credit top-ups are added only after the payment provider confirms the transaction.":"Os preços do catálogo são ₦4, $0,50, £0,37, €0,35 e CA$0,68 por crédito. O valor final é calculado no servidor na moeda selecionada. As recargas só são adicionadas após a confirmação da transação pelo fornecedor de pagamento.","Nigerian Flutterwave purchases provide 30 days of access and do not renew automatically; purchase again to continue. Paddle plans outside Africa renew monthly. Until in-app cancellation is available, manage a Paddle subscription through its customer portal or provider emails.":"As compras Flutterwave na Nigéria dão 30 dias de acesso e não renovam automaticamente; faça uma nova compra para continuar. Os planos Paddle fora de África renovam mensalmente. Até existir cancelamento na aplicação, faça a gestão da subscrição Paddle no portal do cliente ou nos e-mails do fornecedor.","No payment details required":"Não são necessários dados de pagamento","Monthly plan; regional renewal rules apply":"Plano mensal; aplicam-se regras de renovação regionais"});
Object.assign(L.es,{"Pricing is in a controlled rollout. Checkout is sandbox-only during testing; live charges remain disabled until production approval. Nigerian NGN purchases through Flutterwave provide 30 days of access and require manual renewal. Paddle plans outside Africa are monthly recurring subscriptions. Other currency displays are fixed catalogue prices, not live exchange rates; taxes and available payment methods are confirmed by the provider at checkout.":"Los precios se están habilitando de forma gradual. El pago permanece en modo de prueba durante la validación; los cargos reales están desactivados hasta su aprobación para producción. Las compras en NGN en Nigeria mediante Flutterwave dan 30 días de acceso y requieren renovación manual. Los planes Paddle fuera de África son suscripciones mensuales recurrentes. Las demás monedas son precios fijos del catálogo, no tipos de cambio en tiempo real; el proveedor confirma los impuestos y métodos disponibles al pagar.","Use AI credits for brainstorming, first drafts, rewriting, summaries and structured content assistance. Usage is checked and deducted on the server; credit top-ups are added only after payment verification.":"Utiliza créditos de IA para generar ideas, primeros borradores, reescrituras, resúmenes y ayuda estructurada con contenido. El uso se comprueba y descuenta en el servidor; las recargas solo se añaden después de verificar el pago.","✦ Server-side credit checks; top-ups are granted only after verified payment":"✦ Créditos comprobados en el servidor; recargas solo tras verificar el pago","The Free plan includes the published free allowances. Paid studios and quotas depend on your plan and the specific feature; some specialist engines remain in preview until their service is enabled.":"El plan Gratis incluye las cuotas gratuitas publicadas. Los estudios de pago y sus límites dependen del plan y de cada función; algunos motores especializados siguen en vista previa hasta que se habilite su servicio.","Core workspace and browser-based studio tools are available. Some specialist engines and advanced cloud workflows remain in staged rollout. Checkout is sandbox-only during testing; live charges are not enabled.":"El espacio de trabajo principal y las herramientas de estudio en el navegador están disponibles. Algunos motores especializados y flujos avanzados en la nube siguen en despliegue gradual. El pago está en modo de prueba; los cargos reales no están habilitados.","The catalogue rates are ₦4, $0.50, £0.37, €0.35 and CA$0.68 per credit. The final amount is calculated on the server in the selected currency. Credit top-ups are added only after the payment provider confirms the transaction.":"Las tarifas del catálogo son ₦4, $0,50, £0,37, €0,35 y CA$0,68 por crédito. El importe final se calcula en el servidor en la moneda seleccionada. Las recargas solo se añaden cuando el proveedor confirma la transacción.","Nigerian Flutterwave purchases provide 30 days of access and do not renew automatically; purchase again to continue. Paddle plans outside Africa renew monthly. Until in-app cancellation is available, manage a Paddle subscription through its customer portal or provider emails.":"Las compras con Flutterwave en Nigeria ofrecen 30 días de acceso y no se renuevan automáticamente; vuelve a comprar para continuar. Los planes Paddle fuera de África se renuevan mensualmente. Hasta que exista la cancelación dentro de la aplicación, gestiona la suscripción Paddle desde su portal de cliente o los correos del proveedor.","No payment details required":"No se requieren datos de pago","Monthly plan; regional renewal rules apply":"Plan mensual; se aplican las reglas regionales de renovación"});
Object.assign(L.ar,{"Pricing is in a controlled rollout. Checkout is sandbox-only during testing; live charges remain disabled until production approval. Nigerian NGN purchases through Flutterwave provide 30 days of access and require manual renewal. Paddle plans outside Africa are monthly recurring subscriptions. Other currency displays are fixed catalogue prices, not live exchange rates; taxes and available payment methods are confirmed by the provider at checkout.":"يتم إطلاق الأسعار تدريجيًا. تظل عملية الدفع في وضع الاختبار أثناء التحقق، وتبقى المدفوعات الحقيقية معطلة حتى الموافقة على الإنتاج. تمنح مشتريات NGN في نيجيريا عبر Flutterwave وصولًا لمدة 30 يومًا وتتطلب التجديد يدويًا. خطط Paddle خارج أفريقيا اشتراكات شهرية متجددة. الأسعار بالعملات الأخرى ثابتة في الكتالوج وليست أسعار صرف مباشرة؛ ويؤكد مزود الدفع الضرائب ووسائل الدفع المتاحة عند إتمام الدفع.","Use AI credits for brainstorming, first drafts, rewriting, summaries and structured content assistance. Usage is checked and deducted on the server; credit top-ups are added only after payment verification.":"استخدم أرصدة الذكاء الاصطناعي لتوليد الأفكار والمسودات وإعادة الصياغة والملخصات والمساعدة في تنظيم المحتوى. يتم التحقق من الاستخدام وخصمه على الخادم، ولا تضاف الأرصدة إلا بعد التحقق من الدفع.","✦ Server-side credit checks; top-ups are granted only after verified payment":"✦ التحقق من الأرصدة على الخادم؛ لا تضاف الأرصدة إلا بعد تأكيد الدفع","The Free plan includes the published free allowances. Paid studios and quotas depend on your plan and the specific feature; some specialist engines remain in preview until their service is enabled.":"تتضمن الخطة المجانية المخصصات المجانية المنشورة. تعتمد الاستوديوهات المدفوعة والحصص على خطتك والميزة المحددة؛ وتظل بعض المحركات المتخصصة في وضع المعاينة حتى تفعيل خدمتها.","Core workspace and browser-based studio tools are available. Some specialist engines and advanced cloud workflows remain in staged rollout. Checkout is sandbox-only during testing; live charges are not enabled.":"مساحة العمل الأساسية وأدوات الاستوديو التي تعمل في المتصفح متاحة. لا تزال بعض المحركات المتخصصة وسير العمل السحابي المتقدم قيد الإطلاق التدريجي. الدفع في وضع الاختبار؛ والمدفوعات الحقيقية غير مفعلة.","The catalogue rates are ₦4, $0.50, £0.37, €0.35 and CA$0.68 per credit. The final amount is calculated on the server in the selected currency. Credit top-ups are added only after the payment provider confirms the transaction.":"أسعار الكتالوج لكل رصيد هي ₦4 و$0.50 و£0.37 و€0.35 وCA$0.68. يحسب الخادم المبلغ النهائي بالعملة المحددة. لا تضاف الأرصدة إلا بعد تأكيد مزود الدفع للمعاملة.","Nigerian Flutterwave purchases provide 30 days of access and do not renew automatically; purchase again to continue. Paddle plans outside Africa renew monthly. Until in-app cancellation is available, manage a Paddle subscription through its customer portal or provider emails.":"تمنح مشتريات Flutterwave في نيجيريا وصولًا لمدة 30 يومًا ولا تتجدد تلقائيًا؛ أعد الشراء للمتابعة. تتجدد خطط Paddle خارج أفريقيا شهريًا. إلى حين توفر الإلغاء داخل التطبيق، أدر اشتراك Paddle عبر بوابة العملاء أو رسائل مزود الخدمة.","No payment details required":"لا يلزم إدخال بيانات الدفع","Monthly plan; regional renewal rules apply":"خطة شهرية؛ تطبق قواعد التجديد الإقليمية"});

Object.assign(L.fr,{"TAMPSLAT CHECKOUT":"PAIEMENT TAMPSLAT","Choose your payment provider":"Choisissez votre prestataire de paiement","Your region helps us select the available secure payment provider.":"Votre région nous aide à sélectionner le prestataire de paiement sécurisé disponible.","Flutterwave · Local checkout":"Flutterwave · Paiement local","Nigeria and supported African countries. Bank transfer, cards and USSD where available.":"Nigeria et pays africains pris en charge. Virement bancaire, cartes et USSD selon disponibilité.","Paddle · International checkout":"Paddle · Paiement international","For supported countries and payment methods.":"Pour les pays et moyens de paiement pris en charge.","Secure payment":"Paiement sécurisé","Payment details are entered only on the provider's hosted checkout page. TAMPslat does not collect your card or bank details here.":"Les informations de paiement sont saisies uniquement sur la page sécurisée du prestataire. TAMPslat ne recueille pas vos données de carte ou bancaires ici.","Continue securely":"Continuer en toute sécurité","Choose a plan to continue.":"Choisissez une offre pour continuer.","Continue with AI credit top-up":"Continuer avec la recharge de crédits IA","Connecting securely…":"Connexion sécurisée…","Checking secure checkout availability for your region…":"Vérification de la disponibilité du paiement sécurisé dans votre région…","Secure checkout is ready. Redirecting to the payment provider…":"Le paiement sécurisé est prêt. Redirection vers le prestataire…","Secure checkout is currently unavailable. Please try again later.":"Le paiement sécurisé est actuellement indisponible. Veuillez réessayer plus tard.","Try again securely":"Réessayer en toute sécurité"});
